  <!--
    Writer 2027 Type System picker (remediation spec 16-21, 41-45).

    WeldToolbarPopup requires the popover's direct child container to carry the
    stable id "container" (svtools toolbarmenu.cxx: weld_container("container")).

    Design decisions:
    - No hard-coded 240 px scrolled preset list: seven presets fit without a
      scrollbar on a normal/4K work area (vscrollbar-policy=never).
    - "Custom typography" is CURRENT state, not a fake preset row.
    - Left column = CURRENT + PRESETS (selectable systems only).
    - Right column = one rich preview panel per selected preset, visually
      separated (border + distinct background).
    - Apply button applies the selected system and closes (spec 19).
    - Target logical width 760 (min 680, max 880), clamped by the framework.
  -->
